First: What is coupling?
Coupling = how strongly one class depends on another class.

For example:
class OrderService {
    private MySQLDatabase db = new MySQLDatabase();
}

OrderService is tightly coupled to MySQLDatabase.

If you later want to use PostgreSQL, you have to modify OrderService.
